# Commands

Role: command reference for **[[.Name]]**. Canonical list is identical in
`AGENTS.md` and Core CI (REQ-062). Architecture authority is
`docs/architecture.md`.

## Development

```bash
gofmt -l .                 # formatting check (CI); gofmt -w . to fix
go test -count=1 ./...     # uncached tests
go vet ./...
go tool staticcheck ./...
go tool govulncheck ./...  # scheduled/strict
go build ./...
```

Build the primary binary:

```bash
go build -o bin/[[.Binary]] ./cmd/[[.Binary]]
```

## Binary

```bash
./bin/[[.Binary]] --help
./bin/[[.Binary]] version
./bin/[[.Binary]] version --output json
```

Exit statuses (CLI-style tools): `0` success, `1` runtime failure, `2` usage
error, `130` interrupted.

## CI mapping

| Gate | Commands |
| ---- | -------- |
| PR/default (`ci.yml`) | `gofmt -l .`, `go mod verify`, `go test -count=1 ./...`, `go vet ./...`, `go tool staticcheck ./...` |
| Strict (`strict.yml`) | `go tool govulncheck ./...`, race (preflighted), macOS test/vet, bounded fuzz when targets exist |

There is no Makefile, Taskfile, or other task runner. Invoke Go tools directly.
